re prices"}, {"url": "https://newspaceeconomy.ca/2026/02/27/satellite-ridesharing-market-analysis-2026/", "label": "New Space Economy, rideshare market 2026"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In space, whoever owns the ride decides the orbit and the date.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://newspaceeconomy.ca/2026/02/27/satellite-ridesharing-market-analysis-2026/", "label": "New Space Economy, rideshare market 2026"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Rideshare costs about $7,000 per kg, but the rocket picks the orbit and the date. Space tugs sell the last mile.", "sectionKey": "thesis"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
