($ml$180e2be1-6d7a-55d2-8e2b-20c90ae134fc$ml$::uuid, $ml$6d65160c-63ac-5d92-a8e1-7af810ea94b8$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 22 · The numbers$ml$, $ml$In 1966, NASA got 4.41% of the federal budget. By 2019, it got 0.49%. At the height of Apollo, about one federal dollar in 23 went to NASA. In fiscal 2019 its $21.5 billion budget was less than half a cent of each federal dollar. Congress passed $24.4 billion for fiscal 2026.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.statista.com/chart/amp/17504/nasas-budget-share-of-the-us-federal-budget", "label": "Statista, NASA's share of the federal budget"}, {"url": "https://space.com/space-exploration/in-rejection-of-trumps-deep-cuts-congress-passes-usd24-4-billion-budget-for-nasa", "label": "Space.com, NASA fiscal 2026 budget"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b05265c8-bde9-50ff-b31f-446805f955d6$ml$::uuid, $ml$6d65160c-63ac-5d92-a8e1-7af810ea94b8$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The metric$ml$, $ml$Budget share shows priority better than dollar totals. NASA's share of federal spending shrank about ninefold from 1966 to 2019.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.statista.com/chart/amp/17504/nasas-budget-share-of-the-us-federal-budget", "label": "Statista, NASA's share of the federal budget"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$a5a20961-89f0-56d5-8d61-13b8f3379d24$ml$::uuid, $ml$6d65160c-63ac-5d92-a8e1-7af810ea94b8$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The peak$ml$, $ml$The peak came with one national goal: landing on the Moon. The share topped out in 1966, three years before Apollo 11.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.statista.com/chart/amp/17504/nasas-budget-share-of-the-us-federal-budget", "label": "Statista, NASA's share of the federal budget"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$a0d4c8c4-7974-56f1-92c3-d7160dda0735$ml$::uuid, $ml$6d65160c-63ac-5d92-a8e1-7af810ea94b8$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Read budgets as shares$ml$, $ml$A rising dollar total can still be a falling priority. Compare a budget with total federal spending.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.statista.com/chart/amp/17504/nasas-budget-share-of-the-us-federal-budget", "label": "Statista, NASA's share of the federal budget"}]$ml$::jsonb),
