($ml$5e095c85-6cd8-53b3-ab8d-1e2e338b0f32$ml$::uuid, $ml$96a85b5a-76a3-5ee9-a94d-603f9f733337$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 24 · Where it breaks$ml$, $ml$Perseverance has collected more than 30 Mars samples, and NASA has no funded way to bring them back. An independent review put Mars Sample Return at up to $11 billion, with samples not home until 2040. NASA asked industry for a cheaper, faster plan in 2024. In January 2026, Congress passed a NASA budget that does not support the existing program. China plans to launch Tianwen-3 in 2028 and return samples in 2031.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.livescience.com/space/mars/nasas-mars-sample-return-is-dead-leaving-china-to-retrieve-signs-of-life-from-the-red-planet", "label": "Live Science, Mars Sample Return cancelled"}, {"url": "https://spaceflightnow.com/2024/04/16/nasa-requests-proposals-to-reduce-cost-timeline-of-mars-sample-return-mission/", "label": "Spaceflight Now, NASA seeks cheaper Mars Sample Return"}]$ml$::jsonb),
