($ml$76b8af82-5015-58d8-80cf-b20f912a7405$ml$::uuid, $ml$2be3b067-2af2-53ae-b3e2-5f52bc046692$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The scale$ml$, $ml$The filing dwarfs anything in orbit. Starlink had about 9,400 active satellites in early 2026.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://spaceinafrica.com/2021/10/14/rwanda-has-submitted-itu-filing-for-27-orbital-shells-of-327320-satellites/", "label": "Space in Africa, Rwanda's ITU filing"}, {"url": "https://teslanorth.com/2026/01/25/starlink-satellites-made-300000-moves-to-avoid-collisions-in-2025", "label": "TeslaNorth, citing SpaceX filing to the FCC"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$8d6a2412-4ae1-53d1-be86-52a61af8ca70$ml$::uuid, $ml$2be3b067-2af2-53ae-b3e2-5f52bc046692$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The problem$ml$, $ml$Paper filings blur the picture of what will really fly. The ITU's milestones aim to keep its register close to reality.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://itu.int/en/mediacentre/backgrounders/Pages/Non-geostationary-satellite-systems.aspx", "label": "ITU, non-geostationary satellite systems"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$2004c9af-96cd-55f0-8664-fa4dacfa6c6c$ml$::uuid, $ml$2be3b067-2af2-53ae-b3e2-5f52bc046692$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Telling real from paper$ml$, $ml$Regulators, investors and operators all need better ways to judge which filings will actually launch. A subset, CINNAMON-217, alone covered 52,080 satellites.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://spaceinafrica.com/2021/10/14/rwanda-has-submitted-itu-filing-for-27-orbital-shells-of-327320-satellites/", "label": "Space in Africa, Rwanda's ITU filing"}, {"url": "https://itu.int/en/mediacentre/backgrounders/Pages/Non-geostationary-satellite-systems.aspx", "label": "ITU, non-geostationary satellite systems"}]$ml$::jsonb),
